Fixed. Resolved the `js/postTestReworkResults.js` conflict hunk by adopting main's gh-1244 shape exactly:

```javascript
var trackerHolder = trackersModule.createTrackerHolder();
var initTracker = trackerHolder.initTracker;
var getTracker = trackerHolder.getTracker;
```

The `shared` require stays — `readFileOrNull` and `triggerAutoStartReviewWorkflow` still delegate to `postStoryTestAutomationShared` (whose `createTrackerHolder` is itself now a thin delegate to `trackers.js`, so both paths converge on the same canonical). Pushed as the merge commit `271f04bb`; `git merge-tree` against `origin/main` reports no conflicts, and `test_postTestReworkResults` (full suite) passes.
